Wraithsong - The Ashen Choir
“Their hymns are not heard by the living alone. Even the dead stir when the Choir sings.”
Weapon Limit: None.
Race Limit: 2 per team.

Choir's Reward - (Passive)
Choir Allies gain 4/8/12/16/20% movement speed.
Extra: This affects you aswell. This does NOT stack.

Reflexive Echo - (Victim)
When hit by a weapon, 5/10/15/20/25% chance to emit a false directional audio ping for attacker.

Ashmark - (Attack)
3/6/9/12/15% chance to mark (highlight) an enemy for 5s. If successful, banish them for 1s.

Lament Shot - (Attack)
Apply a stack of "Lament", at 3 stacks victim experiences delayed feedback (Lag) every .5s for .5/1/1.5/2/2.5 sec.
Also, 3/6/9/12/15% chance to impale and shake screen for 1s. (Duration doesn't apply to Imaple)

Chorus of Static - (Ability1)
Deploy an invisible zone for 1/2/3/4/5s. Enemies are not able to pass through during this time. (Highlight perimeter of effect, i.e. a doorway, vent, etc.)
Type: Ward. Radius: 200u. Range: 800u. CD of 30s.

Dissonant Presence - (Ability2)
Enemies within 50/100/150/200/250u radius hear FAKE faint, irregular audio artifacts (whispers, footsteps, fall damage, door opens, etc.) every 3s for 9s. CD of 30s.
Target: AoE_SELF. Type: Aura 

Black Requiem - (Ultimate)
The battlefield goes quiet. ALL EFFECTS are muted for ALL PLAYERS within 100/200/300/400/500u for 10s. CD of 60s.
Extra: Also, replace audio with (noise Lucky prefers (Logickal moaning, Lucky's Golden Scream, etc.))
Target: AoE_SELF. Type: Ward

